<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Motorola upgraded long-term.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Motorola upgraded long-term.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Brown Brothers Harriman &amp; Co upgraded Motorola Inc to a market outperformer from a market performer on a long-term basis, a source in the firm said on Monday.</p>
<p>--The firm, however, kept its near-term rating of the technology giant at hold, the source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not available.</p>
<p>-- shares finished exchange trading at 54-7/8 unchanged from Friday's closing price.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
